Their contributions were dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 and are
incorporated here on those terms. See NOTICE.


Parallel fork — CC0 1.0, 2019-2026
----------------------------------

A second fork of CivOne is maintained by Christian Wimmer (ChrisWiGit), also
under CC0 1.0. Fixes, performance work and whole features have been taken from
it into this one — 17 commits here name it as their source, between 2026-05-02
and 2026-07-20 — covering city-view frame arithmetic, palette and shield-caching
performance, AI railroad building, goto-move restoration, the conquest finale,
map zoom, empire-size unhappiness and the feature toggles.

    Christian Wimmer <wimmer@teamchris.info>                       2025-2026
    Kevin Routley (fire-eggs)                                      2019-2022

Attribution here is at the level of the fork rather than the line: material
adopted from that project may originate with any of its contributors, so its
other authors are credited alongside its maintainer.

    https://github.com/ChrisWiGit/CivOne


